[01:16.05]➤ kavi bhi phire kaal ke harth
[01:18.66]kahaam katham kathaam
[01:21.28]➤ kahaam gayaa kaun kaho
[01:23.90]➤ katham kathaam kahe kaho
[01:26.51]➤ kathaam ki kathaa kya kya
[01:29.13]➤ kaal ke kaan mein kaun kaa kya
[01:31.75]kasmin kyo keshu
[01:34.37]➤ kasmin jag mein kyo phire
[01:36.98]➤ keshu hi kaa kaanta chire
[01:39.60]➤ kyo kahe kaal kaa khel kare
[01:42.22]➤ kaa kaa bandhan kaahe dhare
[01:44.83]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[01:47.45]➤ rahasya nahi to raaj hai kaala
[01:50.07]➤ kaal kaa kaam hai khel dikhaana
[01:52.69]➤ ka kaa arth hai kaal bhulaana
[01:55.30]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[01:57.92]nai bramaand racha daalaa
[02:00.54]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[02:03.15]➤ naanak bhi ka kaa kahe gaye
[02:05.77]➤ kaa kaa uttar kaal se gaye
[02:08.39]➤ maatvaale ko kaun sambhaale
[02:11.01]➤ kaa kaa chakkar kaal nivaale
[02:13.62]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[02:16.24]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[02:18.86]➤ kadaa na chhute – kaal kaa haath
[02:21.47]➤ kachcha kaahe – kachcha saath
[02:24.09]➤ karpaan uthaave – kaal kaa naath
[02:26.71]➤ kanghi kare – kesh bhi raakhe
[02:29.33]➤ kaal ke aage sab kuchh bhaakhe
[02:31.94]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[02:34.56]➤ sakkha kaun – jo kaal na jaane
[02:37.18]➤ bhesh badale – kaal pahichaane
[02:39.79]➤ kaal jo pahichaan liya
[02:42.41]➤ ka kaa rahasya aap hi aaya
[02:45.03]chanddalaa de dna nai
[02:47.65]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[02:50.26]➤ dohkaa kaun – jo kaal de daale
[02:52.88]➤ kaal se bachna – ka kaa samhaale
[02:55.50]➤ ka kaa bina kaal kaa raaj
[02:58.11]➤ ka kaa mile to kaal ka kaaj
