[03:11.20]kasmin kyo keshu
[03:13.82]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[03:16.43]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[03:19.05]nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[03:21.67]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[03:24.29]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[03:26.90]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[03:29.52]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[03:32.14]chanddalaa de dna nai
[03:34.75]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[03:37.37]ka... kaa... kya... kyo...
[03:39.99]kahan kab tak kisko kyon
[03:42.61]khalq khuda kufr karam
[03:45.22]khoon kaleje kaa, kaghaz kalam
[03:47.84]khaali karo kya kahe kabeer
[03:50.46]kankar kaahe karein taqeer
[03:53.07]kuttaa kaalaa kya jaane
[03:55.69]kaaba kaun, kaun but-khaana
[03:58.31]kaafir kahe kaaba chale
[04:00.93]qazi kahe qabar chale
[04:03.54]kaa de chakkar mein kaalaa phire
[04:06.16]kaal kaa kaal kahaan se tire
[04:08.78]kadaa na toota, kes na kaate
[04:11.39]kanghi na rukhi, karpaan na haathe
[04:14.01]kachcha kaahe kaa rakhdaa baandh
[04:16.63]kaal kaa khel, na jaane aadh
[04:19.25]khaak se kaaya, kaaya se kaam
[04:21.86]kaam se krodh, krodh se jaam
[04:24.48]kaun si kaayaa kaahe si kathaa
[04:27.10]kaa kaa rahasya – bas kaal kaa naath
[04:29.71]kahaam gaye sab kavim kaviim
[04:32.33]kavayah kaahe bane nayeem
[04:34.95]kasmin jag mein kyo nahi chain
[04:37.57]keshu hi to hai maaya mail
[04:40.18]ka kau ke – teeno paal
[04:42.80]ken kabhyaam – dohe ka jaal
[04:45.42]kai – kaahe ko kai baar
[04:48.03]kathaam katham – kahta hai koi bichaar
[04:50.65]ka kaa rahasya – kya bataaye
[04:53.27]kya likhe kaghaz kya mitaaye
[04:55.89]jeh kavan kahan kis karan
[04:58.50]so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
